-- title:
--   Order constant 256 makes the global moment error at most 1/n
-- statement:
--   Write \(a_n=\log n/\log\log n\) and \(L_C(n)=\lceil Ca_n\rceil_+\),
--   where \(\lceil x\rceil_+=\max\{0,\lceil x\rceil\}\). Let
--   \[
--   h_L(S)=\left(\frac{4e^{S^2}(S^2)^{2L+1}}{(2L+1)!}\right)^{1/2}.
--   \]
--   For every fixed \(S\ge0\), all sufficiently large integers
--   \(n\) satisfy
--   \[
--   h_{L_{256}(n)}(S)\le n^{-1}.
--   \]
